<statement>
<p>Solve the equation: <m>\displaystyle{3}{\left({10}^{{-{10}{x}}}\right)}-{15}={0}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}=</m><fillin characters="6"/> </p>
<p>Round to 3 decimal places.</p>

</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>-0.07</li></ul></p>
</answer>
<solution><p><m>\displaystyle{3}{\left({10}^{{-{10}{x}}}\right)}-{15}={0}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{3}{\left({10}^{{-{10}{x}}}\right)}={15}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{10}^{{-{10}{x}}}=\frac{{15}}{{3}}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle-{10}{x}={\log{{\left(\frac{{15}}{{3}}\right)}}}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}=\frac{{\log{{\left(\frac{{15}}{{3}}\right)}}}}{{-{{10}}}}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}\approx-{0.07}</m></p></solution>
</myopenmath>